{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/905133-demonic-gadgets-for-the-non-demonic","id":905133,"title":"Demonic Gadgets for the non-Demonic","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-01T13:16:50-07:00","id":905133,"title":"Demonic Gadgets for the non-Demonic","content":"Demons can install any of their Embeds or Exploits (or even their own Form abilities) into Gadgets. Which anyone can use.<br /> <br /> But some Embeds and Exploits seem very much tied to the Unchained condition. How do Gadgets with Alibi, Going Native, Merge, Demon House, Context Matters, or Terrible Avatar work for someone without Cover or a Demonic Form? Are they simply non-functional for beings other than the Unchained? What kind of Near-Field effects would be necessary to make them more widely applicable?<br /> <br /> Example:<br /> I've got some vague idea to use a Near-Field Going Native batch of One-Shots to play with the Solace plot hook for Vampire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T13:29:44-07:00","id":905141,"title":"","content":"I think it comes down to a question of what do Cover and Demonic Form do for the Demon and how do you translate that to humans. How I understand that then is that Cover is identity, history, and what makes up that. Demonic Form is not just physical parts of the demon but additional utility. So for a human I would see something that would effect Cover could very well deal with their Vice, Virtue, Aspirations and even things like ethnicity. Form could manipulate Attributes, Physical/mental merits, maybe supernatural merits and even minor templates. You could also do things with Terrible Avatar that would create a double of a person that is their &quot;evil&quot; twin who can do things they need with out compromising a breaking point. Demon House could give someone control over the functions of a house in a Mundane sense as well as in a supernatural way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T13:57:11-07:00","id":905157,"title":"","content":"Well, a Terrible Avatar Gadget could summon a pre-programed Avatar based on the maker's form, with similar effects for Demon House and Demon Car. A Context Matters Gadget might allow you to negate breaking points induced by a specific kind of &quot;forget this field&quot; (like Lunacy or Dissonance). Going Native turns a super into a mortal. Alibi allows you to be in two places at once.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T14:19:51-07:00","id":905174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/905133-demonic-gadgets-for-the-non-demonic?p=905157#post905157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, a Terrible Avatar Gadget could summon a pre-programed Avatar based on the maker's form, with similar effects for Demon House and Demon Car.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, but what about Stigmatics, either through <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1TeBwffI5hBVlbE_B_KhTPjU3cnG0L7oR_6RbGq8YX94/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gadgeteer</a> or <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\">Stigmatic!Genii</a>? They don't have Demonic Forms. Just don't pick those?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T14:33:08-07:00","id":905183,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/905133-demonic-gadgets-for-the-non-demonic?p=905174#post905174\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, but what about Stigmatics, either through <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1TeBwffI5hBVlbE_B_KhTPjU3cnG0L7oR_6RbGq8YX94/edit?usp=sharing&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">Gadgeteer</a> or <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">Stigmatic!Genii</a>? They don't have Demonic Forms. Just don't pick those?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe at the creation of of the gadget they could create an avatar using demonic form creation and it can be used as drone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}